{
  "name": "DISCORD - Credits Debit",
  "active": true,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## DISCORD - Credits Debit\n\n**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/credits-debit\n\n**Headers:**\n- `X-Project-ID` (required): ID du projet (ex: torah-fun)\n\n**Body:**\n```json\n{\n  \"discord_user_id\": \"636639897767378954\",\n  \"amount\": 5,\n  \"reason\": \"translation_page_12\"\n}\n```\n\n**API appellee:** POST /api/webhook/account/debit\n\n**Reponses:**\n- 200: Success\n- 402: Insufficient credits\n- 404: User not found",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-doc",
      "name": "Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        64,
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "credits-debit",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-trigger",
      "name": "Webhook Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        448,
        304
      ],
      "webhookId": "credits-debit"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Valider les parametres\nconst input = $input.first().json;\nconst body = input.body || {};\nconst headers = input.headers || {};\n\n// Extraire le project_id du header (case-insensitive)\nconst projectId = headers['x-project-id'] || headers['X-Project-ID'] || null;\nconst discordUserId = body.discord_user_id || null;\nconst amount = body.amount || null;\nconst reason = body.reason || '';\n\nconst errors = [];\nif (!projectId) errors.push('X-Project-ID header');\nif (!discordUserId) errors.push('discord_user_id');\nif (!amount || amount <= 0) errors.push('amount (must be > 0)');\n\nif (errors.length > 0) {\n  return [{\n    json: {\n      valid: false,\n      error: {\n        code: 400,\n        message: `Parametres requis manquants ou invalides: ${errors.join(', ')}`,\n        status: 'BAD_REQUEST'\n      }\n    }\n  }];\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    valid: true,\n    project_id: projectId,\n    discord_user_id: discordUserId,\n    amount: Number(amount),\n    reason: reason\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "validate-input",
      "name": "Validate Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        672,
        304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
